WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.102
Laura writes on WhatsApp asking to see a flat.

2
00:00:07.102 --> 00:00:11.908
Her request arrives as a task, with the reference and the time she asked for.

3
00:00:11.908 --> 00:00:14.086
An agent takes it.

4
00:00:14.086 --> 00:00:19.162
It is hers now. Nobody else can take it.

5
00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:23.836
Once it is done, it leaves the list.
